<title>FRANCE: French minister says new Thomson bid impossible.</title>
<headline>French minister says new Thomson bid impossible.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Industry Minister Franck Borotra said on Wednesday a new bid for state electronics group Thomson SA was &quot;not possible&quot;.</p>
<p>He told parliament that the deadline for bids in the privatisation process had closed on September 16.</p>
</text>
